  <item>
    <title>01【首发】外企人又怎样，混口饭吃而已</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66743ecfb6a841272930614a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66743ecfb6a841272930614a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 14:38:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Sina 阿男，8 年职场人（5 年外企）前谷歌广告策略，职场英语博主，面试教练</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>外企过去刻板印象 VS 如今真实</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>福利特别好 + 轻松？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>相对大部分国内企业好一些，但是不轻松（想往上走，哪里都躺不平）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>英语能力要很强吗？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>有点规模的外企，好几层上级老板也都是中国人，所以没有那么多英语场景，除非是面试流程的外国面试官</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>至于中英夹杂这件事，你早晚会被同化，不要担心</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>文化好？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>DEI 那是经济好的时候，现在也就那么回事</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我该考虑什么？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公司业务前景</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>同事、领导的风格/状态</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvEjVbDCCvSME_0p9tlHgmL-HjXe.m4a" length="5756967" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_uHmt3SVBMV2MRVVXxFaaV9ECV.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09【面试】谈薪福利：不知道肯定要吃亏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642efea966e4c00c6a6612a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642efea966e4c00c6a6612a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Apr 2023 17:17:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>薪资：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Package 薪资年包：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Base salary 基本薪资（税前）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Bonus OTE - On Target Earnings 销售目标达成奖金</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>RSU 股票 if have</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>福利：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>是否坐班？ Fully remote / Office / Hybrid</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有在家办公的福利？WFH - Work From Home</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>假期：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>PTO Paid Time Leave （ 15-20d 参考）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>商业医疗保险：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>是否直付</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>保额多大</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>是否覆盖家属</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>昂贵医院/三甲医院国际部/特需部是否包括</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>其他福利（有则享之，无则正常）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>电话费</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>通勤费</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>工作餐</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkTaWIkoP5D5LLbl2gN_OAcNxT-5.m4a" length="10473132" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_uHmt3SVBMV2MRVVXxFaaV9ECV.png"/>
